  "question": {
    "text": "A tuning fork vibrates with frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>256</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math> and gives one beat per second with the third normal mode of vibration of an open pipe. What is the length of the pipe? (speed of sound in air is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>340</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
